        "comments": "The assembly dhCarBetu1.hap8.1 is based on 92x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and chloroplast genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. This sample is octaploid with basal chromosome number of 8. We have generated 8 curated haplotypes. Note that due to software limitations unplaced content is split between haplotypes 1 and 2 and haplotypes 6 to 8 only contain assembled chromosomes.",
